    "text": "<p>The increasing basicity order of the following compounds is:<br /><br /><img height=\"37\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/66f403ee-6c9f-4486-a178-599bce7f12e1-image.png\" width=\"175\" /><br /><br /><img height=\"35\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26f8c59c-a976-4cea-af7e-2357fa46a7b0-image.png\" width=\"351\" /><br /><br /><img height=\"76\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/33c047f7-a1b6-4515-b531-98c820aea0e7-image.png\" width=\"202\" /><br /><br /><img height=\"71\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/35eaa73f-bf1e-4828-b0e9-15dd8bf76bb8-image.png\" width=\"164\" /></p>",
